&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;Fluency in exploratory data analysis and visualization on complex data sets, and the ability to translate findings into actionable recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;Understanding of sequencing workflows from sample extraction through the instrument, deep enough to tell a biology problem from an analysis problem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;A demonstrated record of assessing a new platform, assay chemistry or method against established benchmarks..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;Clear communication of technical detail to people who do not share your background.&lt;/li&gt;
