&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;25&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;25&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Gynecologic Oncology Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;26&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;26,0,0&quot;&gt;Deep knowledge of gynecologic malignancies, including current treatment paradigms, molecular biomarkers such as HRD, MSI/Lynch, and HPV-related disease, and evolving clinical guidelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;26,1,0&quot;&gt;Provide expert medical guidance on gynecologic oncology clinical use cases, clinical trial design, and complex patient scenarios.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;27&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;27&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Comprehensive Oncology Acumen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
