&lt;li&gt;Perform cost analysis and volume planning for major commodities (e.g., materials, components, equipment, and services).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor the cost of goods, and setup scheduling to negotiate highest quality at best value.&lt;/li&gt;
