&lt;li&gt;Responsible for timely execution of MRO process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expedite, delay, or cancel orders as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Gather, evaluate, and negotiate quotations from suppliers for goods and services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Execute RFPs and RFQs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Enter purchase requisitions to support procurement activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Manage Open Order Report process to support Vendor On-Time Delivery (OTD).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
