&lt;li&gt;Communicates with appropriate departments when problems are suspected or become evident.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interfaces with Accounts Payable, to resolve invoicing discrepancies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reports select vendor specific KPI’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
