rly in both paper and electronic form, and has access to various technologies to access PHI in order to do the job. Protect PHI at all times in line with HIPAA and privacy policies.&lt;br&gt;- Complete HIPAA/PHI privacy, General Policies and Procedure Compliance, and security training as soon as possible, and no later than 30 days after hire.&lt;br&gt;- Maintain current status on all Natera training requirements.&lt;br&gt;- Perform other duties as assigned.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;**PHYSICAL REQUIREMENTS AND WORK ENVIRONMENT&lt;/span&gt;**&lt;br&gt;- Stand and walk for most of the shift, up to 8–10 hours.&lt;br&gt;- Lift, carry, push, and pull up to 50 lbs regularly, including boxes, totes, and loaded carts.&lt;br&gt;- Bend, reach, stoop, and kneel repeatedly.&lt;br&gt;- Perform repetitive hand and wrist motions, including scanning, opening packages, and typing.&lt;br&gt;- Work in a clinical lab environment with possible exposure to biological samples and biohazardous materials, using required PPE.&lt;br&gt;- Work in a fast-paced, high-volume, deadline-driven environment.&lt;br&gt;- Be flexible for shift changes, weekends, holidays, and overtime based on business needs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;*&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;*QUALIFICATIONS**&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;- High school diploma (or equivalent) required.&lt;br&gt;- 0–1 year of experience in a lab, warehouse, logistics, healthcare, or data entry setting preferred.&lt;br&gt;- Previous computer experience required.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;**KNOWLEDGE, SKILLS, AND ABILITIES**&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Strong attention to detail and accuracy in high-volume, physical work.&lt;br&gt;- Willingness to do hands-on tasks of every kind as part of a team.&lt;br&gt;- Ability to learn several workflows and systems, and build toward full accessioning.&lt;br&gt;- Typing speed of at least 45 wpm with high accuracy, or the ability to reach it during training.&lt;br&gt;- Good oral and written communication skills, and sound judgment.&lt;br&gt;- Reliable, organized, self-motivated, and able to work well with others.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
