&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clinical Director, Clinical Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Clinical Director, Clinical Development, leads the clinical and scientific aspects of one or more Natera-sponsored clinical studies and is accountable for study-level clinical data integrity and patient safety. This role contributes to broader program strategy while ensuring high-quality study execution within an established development framework.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Clinical Director drives progress on defined assignments while anticipating challenges and proactively adjusting tactical direction in alignment with senior leadership. This individual serves as a key cross-functional partner, representing the clinical development perspective internally and externally, and plays an important role in advancing research and product vision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Primary Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Study Leadership &amp;amp; Clinical Oversight&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the clinical and scientific aspects of one or more Natera-sponsored clinical studies.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure study-level clinical integrity, data quality, and patient safety.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional study team members to ensure successful adherence to study timelines and budget, and achievement of study milestones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;May oversee the work of Clinical Scientists working on the same or related studies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to program-level strategy in partnership with senior clinical leadership.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze and interpret study data to identify emerging trends, inform decisions and mitigate risks.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate probable obstacles and implement appropriate changes in direction.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clinical input into study design, protocol development, study execution, and data interpretation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain productive relationships with clinical investigators and other key external stakeholders in support of the Natera-Sponsored study portfolio.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Contribution &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive defined assignments from manager while effectively driving progress independently within established structures and communicating regularly on milestones and challenges.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in establishing strategic plans, objectives, and tactics in partnership with manager and Clinical Development team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess risks, analyze information and communicate trade-offs in order to facilitate decisions on goals and priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on problems of moderate scope requiring evaluation of multiple variables and data sources.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exercise sound judgment within defined procedures and practices, ensuring adherence to standard operating procedures and other quality standards for clinical research.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional &amp;amp; Stakeholder Engagement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build productive relationships with cross-functional teams (e.g., Clinical Operations, Regulatory, Biostatistics, Safety, Medical Affairs).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain strong external investigator relationships.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the clinical function in cross-functional meetings and project discussions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regularly interact with senior management as a representative of the clinical team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent company and departmental interests with external stakeholders.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead or support partnership discussions by engaging with senior external leaders.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and pursue opportunities to communicate research and product vision internally and externally.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage executive stakeholders independently within assigned projects.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in limited regulatory interactions as appropriate.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Team Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;May provide indirect supervision, coaching, or mentoring to professional individual contributors.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a resource to team members and support a collaborative, high-performing team culture.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MD (or equivalent medical degree) required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Board Certification/Eligibility in Oncology &amp;amp; Hematology strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 or more years of experience in vitro diagnostics, life sciences or pharmaceutical clinical development; OR 5 or more years post-graduate clinical trials or clinical research experience in the academic setting&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Typically requires 3 or more years of medical monitoring experience&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to work cross-functionally in a matrixed organization in order to measure study progress against plans, proactively communicate challenges and propose solutions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge, Skills, and Abilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive knowledge&amp;nbsp; of clinical trial design, protocol development, informed consent development, case report form construction, study conduct, statistical analysis, data interpretation and clinical study reporting.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of GCP, ICH and applicable guidelines and regulatory requirements.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to assess clinical data and identify safety or operational risks.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective written and verbal English communication skills.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence stakeholders internally and externally.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills and ability to manage multiple priorities.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing stakeholder management capabilities.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently while aligning with broader strategic direction.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Primary Demands and Work Environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operates in a dynamic, cross-functional, matrixed environment.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Requires regular interaction with senior management and external investigators.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;May require periodic travel for site visits, investigator meetings, partnership discussions, or scientific presentations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
