&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced and highly motivated &lt;strong&gt;Clinical Oncology Specialist – Lymphoma (COS) &lt;/strong&gt;to join our growing oncology diagnostics sales team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This field-based role offers an exciting opportunity to drive the adoption and growth of Signatera, Natera&#39;s personalized, tumor-informed circulating tumor DNA (ctDNA) test for molecular residual disease (MRD), with a primary focus on lymphoma.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate brings a strong background in hematology/oncology sales, established relationships within academic and community cancer centers, and a passion for advancing precision oncology. You will play a critical role in expanding access to innovative molecular diagnostics, building strategic partnerships with healthcare providers, and supporting improved patient care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Sales Growth: Achieve and exceed sales objectives by increasing Signatera adoption, expanding the customer base, developing new accounts, and maximizing revenue opportunities throughout the territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and Execute Territory Strategy: Create and implement a comprehensive territory business plan focused on account acquisition, customer retention, market expansion, and sustainable revenue growth.&lt;/li&gt;
