&lt;li&gt;Serve as a Clinical and Product Resource: Develop expertise in Signatera, molecular diagnostics, hematologic malignancies, the oncology patient journey, competitive offerings, and reimbursement dynamics to effectively communicate the clinical value of Natera&#39;s solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate Cross-Functionally: Partner with solid tumor-focused Clinical Oncology Specialists (COS), Associate Clinical Oncology Specialists (ACOS), Medical Affairs, and internal teams to strengthen account relationships, address operational challenges, and support customer success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize Account Performance: Identify opportunities to increase test utilization, improve workflow efficiency, resolve missing information (MI) issues, and maximize account growth and retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute Commercial Initiatives: Implement strategic sales and marketing initiatives, identify market opportunities, and leverage business insights to drive adoption across academic and community oncology settings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
