&lt;p&gt;• Must have strong interpersonal and organizational skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Computer skills (MS Word, Excel, PowerPoint, etc.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Familiar with DNA Isolation and Purification, PCR, Cell Culture, Sequencing, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Experience with automation and sequencing instrumentation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
