&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;8-10 years of experience in privacy, data governance, compliance, or related disciplines, with increasing leadership responsibility&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong expertise in global privacy regulations (HIPAA, GDPR, CCPA/CPRA, etc.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
