&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EMR Integration &amp;amp; Contracting:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead enterprise-level initiatives focused on electronic medical record (EMR) integrations, strategic contracting, and solutions that streamline workflows and expand access to Natera&#39;s testing portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with commercial and operational teams across Women&#39;s Health, Organ Health, Oncology, and Rare Disease to align business priorities, remove barriers, and maximize enterprise-wide opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
