&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PRIMARY RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Assists certified/licensed personnel in clinical patient testing in accordance with the SOP&lt;/p&gt;
