&lt;p&gt;The User Services / Helpdesk Specialist 2 is responsible for all aspects of IT end-user support in an enterprise biotech environment including: computer hardware, software, office systems, peripherals, phone, voicemail systems, and provides assistance to system administrators as required. As a member of a helpdesk team, position provides IT services via walk-up, phone, email and ticketing systems. The candidate must have a high level of aptitude for analyzing, troubleshooting, and resolving problems with an emphasis on follow-through and customer satisfaction.&lt;/p&gt;
