&lt;li style=&quot;color: #262626 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #262626;&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of Illumina sequencing platforms, liquid biopsy (ctDNA), and tissue-based CGP assays.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
