&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Natera is currently seeking a Bioinformatics Manager to join the Bioinformatics team focused on Oncology Product Development. In this role, the individual will manage a team of Bioinformaticians and Data Scientists and provide technical leadership in the design, development and validation of ctDNA-based diagnostic tests. This position requires extensive cross-functional collaboration with biostatistics, molecular biology, software engineering and commercial departments. The ideal candidate will have a strong background in bioinformatics and data science, optimally with experience in the LDT assay development space, and an established record of project and technical leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PRIMARY RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Provide technical leadership for product development projects by representing the bioinformatics team in cross-functional interactions and moving products through the full development process through validation and commercial launch.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Lead the effort to optimize workflows, improve tools and pressure test analysis pipelines for diagnostic tests, including the detection of cancer-associated variants and the implementation of evidence-based quality control thresholds.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Supervise bioinformatics scientists and data scientists, managing their technical contributions, prioritizing resources, and taking responsibility for their technical and professional development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Provide input on experiment design, analysis and interpretation based on expert understanding of Natera’s technology and relevant mathematical principles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Work at a high level of independence and responsibilities in carrying out assignments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Contribute to our intellectual property portfolio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
