&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Master’s degree or Ph.D. in a quantitative discipline (bioinformatics, engineering, applied mathematics, statistics, or similar).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
