&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Provide input on experiment design, analysis and interpretation based on expert understanding of Natera’s technology and relevant mathematical principles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Work at a high level of independence and responsibilities in carrying out assignments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
