&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Work on the software that powers Natera&#39;s R&amp;amp;D - a small, high-leverage team where individual contribution is highly visible.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Operate at the frontier of AI-augmented software engineering. We don&#39;t just talk about AI tooling - we build it, and use it daily.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
