&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in data analysis and database management (e.g., Excel, SPSS, R).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organizational skills with keen attention to detail and accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to troubleshoot technical issues and provide practical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills with the ability to collaborate effectively with researchers and other staff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with laboratory equipment (e.g., freezers, liquid nitrogen tanks, centrifuges) and ensuring proper calibration and maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in SQL, Python Plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
