&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience working within a CLIA lab environment or under a Quality Management System&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience with epigenetics/methylation, cfDNA/RNA, or digital PCR technologies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience in transplant assessment, oncology, NIPT, or liquid biopsy applications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
