&lt;li&gt;Highly proactive self-starter with strong ownership mindset and ability to work independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quick learner who can ramp up on new systems, processes, and technical topics with minimal guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated track record of identifying and implementing process improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to navigate ambiguity and adapt quickly in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, organizational, and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
