&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Contribute to key design, development, testing, deployment, validation, maintenance, and update activities for DSPE&#39;s software tools and data/cloud/automation systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
