&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Maintain and optimize software/system performance, by monitoring and studying different solutions&#39; impacts on key system metrics, such as network I/O, disk I/O, RAM usage, CPU usage, disk space usage, etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
