&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; line-height: 2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Create training materials, and contribute to training activities, for the DSPE Software Engineering &amp;amp; DevOps team-owned software tools and systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
