&lt;p&gt;As the Senior Director / Director of Breast Oncology Lifecycle Management, this individual will work in a highly matrixed environment to help shape the strategic direction and drive execution for company success in breast cancer.&amp;nbsp; This individual will report directly to the Senior Director/Head of Women’s Cancer Lifecycle Management.&lt;/p&gt;
