&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Drives commercial strategy and success in breast cancer, working closely with broader cross functional teams to create and support execution of a strategic plan that supports adoption across all stakeholders (e.g., academic and community oncology)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Lead the breast cancer lifecycle team in defining and prioritizing key indications and developing a roadmap to fill evidence data gaps.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Maintain a deep understanding of the breast cancer space by integrating real-time customer feedback, publications, data presentations, competitive and market intelligence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Define value proposition and messaging framework in collaboration with commercial marketing for Natera’s oncology suite of products in breast cancer based on clinical evidence and the competitive landscape.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Provide commercial insights to optimize the success of Signatera in breast cancer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
