&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building custom LIMS/LES systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with LabVantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in Austin, TX, to work shoulder-to-shoulder with lab operations and gather live feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
