&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Network platforms including Juniper, Palo Alto Networks, Cisco Meraki, and Opengear.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cloud networking concepts, preferably within AWS environments.&lt;/p&gt;
