&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SENIOR SCIENTIST, Molecular Biology R&amp;amp;D&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Location: San Carlos, CA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Department: Molecular Biology, Informatics, and Statistics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;POSITION SUMMARY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Senior Scientist to join our highly collaborative Molecular Biology Research team. The Senior Scientist, will plan, design, and execute laboratory research to advance Natera’s growing liquid biopsy-based early cancer detection product portfolio. For this role, we require a candidate with experience developing NGS assays, with the ideal candidate having a demonstrated track record of creatively applying multiomic approaches to oncology applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PRIMARY RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Contributes intellectually and creatively to research and development planning and innovation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Advances novel nucleic acid based diagnostic tests including, planning, feasibility testing, protocol development, optimization, and transfer to Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Responsible for project-associated timeline and deliverable planning and management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Thoroughly comprehends the objectives and vision of the work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Independently develops generates and advances new ideas&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Independently designs and executes high complexity experiments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Coordinates the execution and analysis of experiments with statistics and bioinformatics teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Actively interacts and communicates with interdepartmental teams such as Operations, Program Management, Bioinformatics, Data Science, Engineering, Translational Science, and Product&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Documents research progress under a Quality Management System&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Communicates progress directly with manager and colleagues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Performs basic data analysis (e.g. R, JMP, Excel)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;May manage research associates&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Employee must complete training relating to HIPAA/PHI privacy, General Policies and Procedure&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Compliance training and security training as soon as possible but not later than the first 30 days of hire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Must maintain a current status on Natera training requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Perform other duties as assigned&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Ph.D. in molecular biology, genomics, biochemistry or a closely related field&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Minimum of 5 - 8 years of industry experience or 2+ years post-doctoral research and 3+ years of industry experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REQUIRED SKILLS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Must have extensive experience designing, executing, analyzing data and problem solving of next generation sequencing (NGS) and DNA molecular biology experiments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Track record of originating, developing and/or productizing novel nucleic acid and multiomic workflows and tests&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Strong research skills with a history of innovation and scientific accomplishment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Must have excellent communication, organizational, record-keeping, planning, time management and analytical skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated success in applying independent scientific judgment in experimental design and analysis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND KNOWLEDGE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Cancer research experience is desired&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #000000 !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Experience with approaches such as: epigenetic/methylation analysis, target capture/enrichment, WGS, proteomics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
