&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to Workday Illuminate / AI features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Workday ecosystem add-ons (e.g., Paradox, Sana, and other governance/reporting tools).&lt;/li&gt;
